{"2986980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Enigma Heart", "steam_appid": 2986980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39b07fba4b06157b63028d1269c459c5.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"An adventure at the crossroads of love and rebellion!\" width=1440 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"Montage of gameplay snippets featuring melee combat, exploration using mobility techniques such as sliding and climbing, and combat magic.\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of your past and ignite a rebellion in <i>Enigma Heart</i>, an emotional side-scrolling action RPG inspired by 8- and 16-bit classics. Explore an oppressed kingdom by foot and by sea, master melee combat and versatile magic, unlock hidden paths, and out-maneuver a tyrannical king to help heal a broken land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/6417f5fc00bfe430365cff9be34c4fde.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"Story\" width=1440 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up on the shores of a quiet seaside village with amnesia but also a strange knack for the sword, Zalia is nursed back to health by the local innkeeper Esme. As she pieces her past and her identity back together, she realizes her personal trauma is tangled with the fate of the entire realm of Lufain: a nation doing its best to thrive under the iron-fisted rule of a paranoid, defensive tyrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/55dfcb09d299238b0c397f0b421a520c.avif?t=1781671448\" alt=\"A cozy pixel art tavern scene, featuring a gorup of four friends sitting at a table together. One character at the table is looking over her shoulder. Another is listening intently as his friends nearby, two women, share a laugh.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras_big/55dfcb09d299238b0c397f0b421a520c.avif?t=1781671448 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of a lonely avenger, but of a community built from the ground up. It's a story of found family, a romance that heals the spirit, and the friends made along the way. Through it all, Zalia's true superpower isn't sorcery or the blade, but empathy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/9f31cc982e80c366411cb5829b38c518.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"Features\" width=1440 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"A snippet of gameplay action. The player character falls from a great height into a pit, but catches herself on the ledge and pulls herself up. She then uses a downstab technique to pogo along a line of enemies positioned over a bottomless pit.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant exploration across the kingdom of Lufain, with hidden secrets, upgrades, and optional treasures waiting for you to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable spells and abilities that enhance both combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible difficulty settings let you customize the challenge to match your play style: tough, forgiving, or anywhere in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system inspired by classic action RPGs, blending swordplay, magic, and strategic defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes of transport that open up new areas and hidden locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative with deep, character-driven storytelling, including a sapphic love story at the heart of the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles and hidden tasks that reward players with unique upgrades and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art with a colorful, 16-bit-inspired aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"Montage of gameplay snippets featuring the player character fighting her way through caves and forests, and demonstrating techniques such as her down stab, up stab, the ability to reflect projectiles back at enemies with her sword, and riding a horse on the overworld.\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39b07fba4b06157b63028d1269c459c5.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"An adventure at the crossroads of love and rebellion!\" width=1440 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"Montage of gameplay snippets featuring melee combat, exploration using mobility techniques such as sliding and climbing, and combat magic.\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/39051b2536b3f57a7b5c27031dde2a2f.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of your past and ignite a rebellion in <i>Enigma Heart</i>, an emotional side-scrolling action RPG inspired by 8- and 16-bit classics. Explore an oppressed kingdom by foot and by sea, master melee combat and versatile magic, unlock hidden paths, and out-maneuver a tyrannical king to help heal a broken land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/6417f5fc00bfe430365cff9be34c4fde.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"Story\" width=1440 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up on the shores of a quiet seaside village with amnesia but also a strange knack for the sword, Zalia is nursed back to health by the local innkeeper Esme. As she pieces her past and her identity back together, she realizes her personal trauma is tangled with the fate of the entire realm of Lufain: a nation doing its best to thrive under the iron-fisted rule of a paranoid, defensive tyrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/55dfcb09d299238b0c397f0b421a520c.avif?t=1781671448\" alt=\"A cozy pixel art tavern scene, featuring a gorup of four friends sitting at a table together. One character at the table is looking over her shoulder. Another is listening intently as his friends nearby, two women, share a laugh.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras_big/55dfcb09d299238b0c397f0b421a520c.avif?t=1781671448 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of a lonely avenger, but of a community built from the ground up. It's a story of found family, a romance that heals the spirit, and the friends made along the way. Through it all, Zalia's true superpower isn't sorcery or the blade, but empathy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/9f31cc982e80c366411cb5829b38c518.webp?t=1781671448\" alt=\"Features\" width=1440 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"A snippet of gameplay action. The player character falls from a great height into a pit, but catches herself on the ledge and pulls herself up. She then uses a downstab technique to pogo along a line of enemies positioned over a bottomless pit.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3f28cdff9593389fcfc1b30cbef08cc9.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant exploration across the kingdom of Lufain, with hidden secrets, upgrades, and optional treasures waiting for you to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable spells and abilities that enhance both combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible difficulty settings let you customize the challenge to match your play style: tough, forgiving, or anywhere in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system inspired by classic action RPGs, blending swordplay, magic, and strategic defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes of transport that open up new areas and hidden locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative with deep, character-driven storytelling, including a sapphic love story at the heart of the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles and hidden tasks that reward players with unique upgrades and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art with a colorful, 16-bit-inspired aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.poster.avif?t=1781671448\" aria-label=\"Montage of gameplay snippets featuring the player character fighting her way through caves and forests, and demonstrating techniques such as her down stab, up stab, the ability to reflect projectiles back at enemies with her sword, and riding a horse on the overworld.\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.webm?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/3a9e97f3ca06261ada01c0908f79e8dd.mp4?t=1781671448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Unravel the mysteries of your past, protect the ones you love, and shape your destiny in Enigma Heart, a modern new take on a classic action RPG formula. Blend exploration, magic, and combat with a variety of new abilities as you stand against the dark forces threatening your homeland.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/b1ced691b6351224b4ad9a5ce0cba4851f528ff8/header.jpg?t=1781671448", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/dc761b98f8ccd91c6d2e8fbaecccb80148f154ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781671448", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/dc761b98f8ccd91c6d2e8fbaecccb80148f154ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781671448", 